# Container isolation: the files lyna-tmux renders for the project.
title lmux sandbox devcontainer init
size 134 36
pre lmux kill --all
pre rm -rf .devcontainer
run demo-shell
wait 1
type clear
enter
wait 0.5
chapter Containers
caption lmux sandbox devcontainer init | the container files of the project, written for it
type lmux sandbox devcontainer init
enter
wait 2.5
frame 3.5
caption ls -la .devcontainer | the image, the firewall and the allowlist it comes up with
type clear; ls -la .devcontainer
enter
wait 1.5
frame 3.5
